THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL (details: THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md)
- tests/data/audioset, tests/data/audioset_strong, tests/data/vggsound: short excerpts (20-50 rows) of the official
  AudioSet, AudioSet Strong and VGGSound metadata files, used as test fixtures; the label-name files contain only
  the rows used by the excerpts. Attribution: Gemmeke et al. (ICASSP 2017), Hershey et al. (ICASSP 2021),
  Chen et al. (ICASSP 2020). No audio and no video is included.
- SALT (tpt-adasp/salt): the mapping and hierarchy files are NOT included (the upstream repository declares no
  licence). They are downloaded on request by "audioset-tools fetch-salt"; the files in tests/data/salt are synthetic.
- Runtime dependencies (numpy, tqdm, and the optional yt-dlp, soundfile, resampy, matplotlib) are installed from PyPI
  and keep their own licences.

